      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 2,
      "text": "Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy\nBench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy\nThe Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy\n Criminal Petition No.306 Of 2020\n Order:",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 52,
      "end": 217,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Cheekati Manavendranath Roy",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 60,
          "end": 87
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheekati Manavendranath Roy",
          "label": "JUDGE",
          "start": 95,
          "end": 122
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheekati Manavendranath Roy",
          "label": "JUDGE",
          "start": 147,
          "end": 174
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "text": "-\nThis petition is filed under Section 439 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 to enlarge the petitioners on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 217,
      "end": 335,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 439",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 248,
          "end": 259
        },
        {
          "text": "Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 267,
          "end": 299
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23856094479560852
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "2. The petitioners are A-1 to A-4 in Crime No.20 of 2020 of Arundalpet Police Station of Guntur District.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 337,
      "end": 442,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Crime No.20 of 2020",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 374,
          "end": 393
        },
        {
          "text": "Arundalpet Police Station of Guntur District",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 397,
          "end": 441
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18260908126831055
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "3. The alleged offences against them are under Sections 307, 353, 420, 273, 188 of Indian Penal Code, 1860 (for short \"I.P.C.\") and Section 8 (c) r/w 20 (b) of Narcotic Drugs and Psychotropic Substances Act, 1985 and Sections 58, 59, 63 of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 (for short \"FSS Act, 2006).",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 444,
      "end": 746,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sections 307",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 491,
          "end": 503
        },
        {
