    "PREAMBLE": "Bonda Manikanta vs State Of Ap on 30 January, 2020\nAuthor: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy\nBench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy\nThe Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy\n Criminal Petition No.306 Of 2020\n Order:\n",
    "facts": "3. The alleged offences against them are under Sections 307, 353, 420, 273, 188 of Indian Penal Code, 1860 (for short \"I.P.C.\") and Section 8 (c) r/w 20 (b) of Narcotic Drugs and Psychotropic Substances Act, 1985 and Sections 58, 59, 63 of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 (for short \"FSS Act, 2006).\nPolice apprehended them.\nAfter their arrest,\nthe police found three white colour plastic covers and black colour polythene covers in their possession.\nWhen they checked the same, they found 200 grams of Ganja and other banned products like Gutka, Khaini etc.\nPolice seized the contraband and arrested them.\nTherefore, the petitioners have committed the aforesaid offences.\n",
